<title>INDIA: India raises H-4, F-414/H-717 cotton prices.</title>
<headline>India raises H-4, F-414/H-717 cotton prices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian government on Monday raised the minimum support prices of H-4 and F-414/H-717 cotton by 150 rupees per quintal, a spokesman said.  </p>
<p>The support price for H-4 cotton was raised to 1,530 rupees per quintal from 1,380.</p>
<p>The government increased the minimum support price for F-414/H-717 cotton to 1,330 rupees per quintal from 1,180.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
